.DS_Store
*.log

# Graphify knowledge graph. Derived output is ignored; the LLM-derived cache and
# labels ARE committed — that is the expensive part (hours of extraction in a
# couple of MB), and it lets a fresh clone rebuild the graph at zero LLM cost.
# SYNTAX: never use `graphify-out/` or `graphify-out/**` — git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, which silently kills every negation below.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cache/*
!graphify-out/cache/semantic-deep/
!graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json
!graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json.sig
